+
+- Worktree: `C:/ArifiLabs/cache/r46b-wt`
+- Branch: `lane-230/r46b-rebased-2026-09-11`
+- Inherited HEAD: `ae831efde` — unchanged. Nothing fetched, pulled, merged, rebased, committed,
